{"id":"n72467-1-12","stage":3,"title":"합격 · 合格","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72467-1-12-1","ko":"나 오늘 면접은 잘 본 것 같아. 느낌이 좋아.","zh":"我觉得我今天的面试表现得不错，感觉挺好的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"면접은","meaning":"面试","explanation":"면접：面试；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"면접","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16121","senseId":"2","lemma":"면접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"면접은","audio":"/audio/248b767811a34a9a8e3b.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느낌이","audio":"/audio/160aa45adfe9857278de.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"61f79720989225b6","term":"면접","zh":"面试","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3","entryId":"16121","definition":"主要在笔试后进行，以跟应试者见面的形式来考察对方的人品、言行的考试。","pronunciation":["면ː접"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c29f7fcdcaec06684274.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72467-1-12-2","ko":"그래? 그렇다면 이제 합격 소식을 기다리는 일만 남았네!","zh":"是吗？那现在就只剩下等待录取通知啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇다면","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；다면：假定某情况成立：“如果、假如……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇다면","audio":"/audio/79d518fe0852e4a863c3.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"합격","meaning":"合格，及格，通过，录取","explanation":"합격：合格，及格，通过，录取。","readings":[{"term":"합격","audio":"/audio/6c1136cf74d35b667520.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72467","senseId":"1","lemma":"합격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합격","audio":"/audio/6c1136cf74d35b667520.mp3"}},{"text":"소식을","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소식을","audio":"/audio/c94ecc68ffffa69da736.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리는","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리는","audio":"/audio/f472fe56e9a0a1a2c62e.mp3"}},{"text":"일만","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일만","audio":"/audio/1389480fd0ac4e420de1.mp3"}},{"text":"남았네!","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남았네","audio":"/audio/b329e820efb46bb60212.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"6c1136cf74d35b66","term":"합격","zh":"合格，及格，通过，录取","audio":"/audio/6c1136cf74d35b667520.mp3","entryId":"72467","definition":"通过考试、检查、审查等。","pronunciation":["합껵"]},{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"71143","definition":"告知远方的人或不常见的人的情况或状况的话或文字。","pronunciation":["소식"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21aa188ef5e17568cfc6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.214,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72467","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.8116,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得我今天的面试表现得不错，感觉挺好的。","是吗？那现在就只剩下等待录取通知啦！","我觉得你用的方法好像不对哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得我今天的面试表现得不错，感觉挺好的。","是吗？那现在就只剩下等待录取通知啦！","我觉得你用的方法好像不对哦。"],"answer":1}]}
